  "solution": {
    "text": "The common components of photochemical smog are Ozone, Nitric oxide, Acrolein, Formaldehyde<br />and Peroxyacehyl nitrate (PAN).<br />Hence Chlorofluorocarbons (CFC) is not common component of photochemical smog.",
